@HostAddress = http://localhost:5240
@Email = testuser@example.com
@Password = Password123!
@NewPassword = NewPassword123!

### =================================================================
### 1. AUTHENTICATION & USER ENDPOINTS
### =================================================================

### 1.1 Register (Kayıt Ol)
# @name register
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/Auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{Email}}",
  "password": "{{Password}}"
}

### 1.2 Login (Giriş Yap ve Token Al)
# @name login
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/Auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{Email}}",
  "password": "{{Password}}"
}

### Değişkenleri kaydetmek için (IDE desteğine göre):
@token = {{login.response.body.token}}
@refreshToken = {{login.response.body.refreshToken}}

### 1.3 Refresh Token (Yeni Access Token Al)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/Auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

### 1.4 Change Password (Şifre Değiştir - [Authorize])
PUT {{HostAddress}}/api/Auth/change-password
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currentPassword": "{{Password}}",
  "newPassword": "{{NewPassword}}"
}

### 1.5 Forgot Password (Şifremi Unuttum)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/Auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{Email}}"
}

### 1.6 Logout (Çıkış Yap / Refresh Token İptal)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/Auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}


### =================================================================
### 2. TODO ITEM (TASK) ENDPOINTS - [Authorize Gerektirir]
### =================================================================

### 2.1 Görev Oluştur (Create Task)
# @name createTodo
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/TodoItems
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "İlk Görevim",
  "description": "API üzerinden oluşturulan test görevi",
  "dueDate": "2026-12-31T23:59:59Z"
}

### Oluşturulan Görevin ID'si:
@todoId = {{createTodo.response.body.id}}

### 2.2 Tüm Aktif Görevleri Listele (Get All Active Tasks)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/TodoItems
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2.3 Tekil Görev Getir (Get Task By Id)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/TodoItems/{{todoId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2.4 Görev Güncelle (Update Task)
PUT {{HostAddress}}/api/TodoItems/{{todoId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Güncellenmiş Görev Başlığı",
  "description": "Açıklama güncellendi",
  "dueDate": "2026-11-30T18:00:00Z"
}

### 2.5 Görevi Tamamla (Complete Task)
PATCH {{HostAddress}}/api/TodoItems/{{todoId}}/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2.6 Görevi Sil (Delete Task - Owner olduğu için Hard Delete)
DELETE {{HostAddress}}/api/TodoItems/{{todoId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2.7 Çöp Kutusunu Listele (Get Trash)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/TodoItems/trash
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2.8 Görevi Geri Getir (Restore Task - Çöp kutusundaki görevler için)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/TodoItems/{{todoId}}/restore
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### =================================================================
### 3. SUBTASK (ALT GÖREV) ENDPOINTS - [Authorize Gerektirir]
### =================================================================

### 3.1 Alt Görev Oluştur (Create SubTask)
# @name createSubTask
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/todoitems/{{todoId}}/subtasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Veritabanı şemasını hazırla"
}

### Oluşturulan Alt Görevin ID'si:
@subTaskId = {{createSubTask.response.body.id}}

### 3.2 Göreve Ait Alt Görevleri Listele (Get SubTasks By TaskId)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/todoitems/{{todoId}}/subtasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3.3 Alt Görevi Tamamla / Durumunu Değiştir (Toggle Complete SubTask)
PATCH {{HostAddress}}/api/subtasks/{{subTaskId}}/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3.4 Alt Görevi Sil (Delete SubTask)
DELETE {{HostAddress}}/api/subtasks/{{subTaskId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

